NEW_SECTION
A hero (gradient headline via fill() + animate(), tweened counters, a flip card) and seven
sections on the shared design system: select and manipulate, motion, layout helpers,
delegated events, data/time/environment, built-in extensions, bad input and known defects.

REASON
CLAUDE.md requires a designed example page for every module. Page-specific CSS is the
fix for three things the core leaves to the consumer, each commented in place: the
explicit height a width slide needs because .vSlide.dim sets height:0, left:0 and
overflow:hidden for the overlay, and the minmax(0,1fr) column so the nowrap code line
does not widen the hero on a phone.
